ps/2836440/extras/ae795deae863280f7198f864344180c5.poster.avif?t=1755150868\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836440/extras/ae795deae863280f7198f864344180c5.webm?t=1755150868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836440/extras/ae795deae863280f7198f864344180c5.mp4?t=1755150868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
